URL: https://jef.works/STcompare/, https://github.com/JEFworks-Lab/STcompare
BugReports: https://github.com/JEFworks-Lab/STcompare/issues
Description: Compares the spatial gene expression patterns of two spatial
    transcriptomics datasets of structurally matched tissues, rasterized onto
    a shared grid of pixels. For each gene, a spatial correlation test gives a
    permutation p-value that accounts for the spatial autocorrelation of both
    patterns (Viladomat et al. (2014) <doi:10.1111/biom.12139>), and a spatial
    fold-change similarity measures how often the expression at matched
    locations is within a fold change. The method is described in Clifton et
    al. (2026) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btag644>.
